  "worked_solution": "We are given the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x-y=-6 \\\\ \\,\\,\\,x+y=7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe determinant of the coefficient matrix is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & \\,\\,-1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to construct ${D}_{y}$, we replace the second column of the coefficient matrix by the right-hand side column of the given system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{y} & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & \\,\\,-6 \\\\ 1 & 7\\end{aligned}|\\end{aligned}\n$$",
